msgid "Sync music playlists"
msgstr "Musik-Wiedergabelisten synchronisieren"

msgctxt "#30612"
msgid "Download Jellyfin music playlists into Kodi as native playlists under Music → Playlists → Kofin."
msgstr "Jellyfin-Musikwiedergabelisten als native Kodi-Wiedergabelisten unter Musik → Wiedergabelisten → Kofin herunterladen."

